<title>USA: TABLE- Wintrust Q2 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Wintrust Q2 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST, Ill. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	profit	  $0.13     loss	 $0.25</p>
<p> Net	profit	  1,126     loss	 1,466</p>
