<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p> Shr	profit	  $0.24     loss	 $0.31</p>
<p> Net	profit	  1,855     loss	 1,822</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,882		    5,885</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Wintrust Financial Corp's assets totaled $857 million as of June 30, 1997, compared with $550 million as of June 30, 1996.</p>
